        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Grimes, Donald Malarkey, Steve Smith, Stan Smith\n- Works: ER, Party of Five, Band of Brothers, American Dad!, I Am the Walrus\n- Roles: Dr. Archie Morris, Will McCorkle, Technical Sergeant Donald Malarkey\n\nFacts:\n- Scott Grimes had prominent roles in ER as Dr. Archie Morris, in Party of Five as Will McCorkle, and in Band of Brothers as Technical Sergeant Donald Malarkey.\n- Donald Malarkey was portrayed by Scott Grimes in the HBO miniseries Band of Brothers.\n- Scott Grimes voices Steve Smith in the animated sitcom American Dad!.\n- The American Dad! episode I Am the Walrus mainly centers on Stan and his son Steve competing for the dominant role in the house.",
